@startuml Chat_Staff
!theme plain

actor "Admin/Staff" as Staff
participant "Frontend\n/src/pages/ChatPage/ChatPage.tsx" as Frontend
participant "Backend API\n/src/controllers/chatNew.controller.ts" as API
participant "Socket Service\n/src/services/socket.service.ts" as Socket
database "MongoDB\n(Collection: conversations, messages)" as DB

Staff -> Frontend: Xem danh sách hội thoại
Frontend -> API: GET /conversations
API -> DB: Query conversations
DB --> API: Danh sách conversations
API --> Frontend: Conversations + unread count
Frontend --> Staff: Hiển thị danh sách

Staff -> Frontend: Chọn hội thoại
Frontend -> API: GET /conversations/:id/messages
API -> DB: Query messages
DB --> API: Messages
API --> Frontend: Messages
Frontend -> Socket: Join conversation room
Socket --> Frontend: Connected
Frontend --> Staff: Hiển thị tin nhắn

Staff -> Frontend: Gửi tin nhắn và file
Frontend -> Socket: Emit message:send
Socket -> API: Xác thực quyền, lưu message
API -> DB: Lưu message, cập nhật unreadCount
DB --> API: Message saved
API -> Socket: Phát event message:new
Socket --> Frontend: Real-time message update

Staff -> Frontend: Đánh dấu đã đọc
Frontend -> API: POST /conversations/:id/read
API -> DB: Cập nhật lastReadAt, unreadCount = 0
DB --> API: Updated
API --> Frontend: Success

Staff -> Frontend: Xem số tin nhắn chưa đọc
Frontend -> API: GET /messages/unread-count
API -> DB: Tính tổng unreadCount
DB --> API: Total unread count
API --> Frontend: Unread count
Frontend --> Staff: Hiển thị badge

@enduml

